    {
      "data": {
        "text": "- **TURF Analysis (`SPSSINC TURF`) Full SPSS Parity (Features 034–036):**\n  - Implemented clean-room combinatorial Total Unduplicated Reach and Frequency engine in `statcraft_algo` (`turf.rs`, `turf_types.rs`, `turf_heats.rs`, `turf_tests.rs`) using packed `Vec<u64>` respondent bitsets, `WEIGHT BY` and `filter_$` support, `FORCE`, `MINPERCENT`, `REMOVALCYCLES`, `MAXSETS` checked `u128` operation guard, `IMPORTANCE` weights (`STRICT=YES/NO`), and deterministic Tournament Heats (`HEATSIZE`, `NUMWINNERS`) for large variable sets.\n  - Added `stat.turf` `CommandBus` command (`turf_cmd.rs`) and full `SPSSINC TURF` / `TURF` `.sps` syntax round-trip (`CRITERIA=`, `BESTN=`, `NUMBERTODISPLAY=`, `MINPERCENT=`, `PLOT=`, `REMOVALCYCLES=`, `MAXSETS=`, `/HEATS`, `/IMPORTANCE`).\n  - Added `TurfDialog` with `Importance Weights...` and `Advanced Selection...` subdialogs using `DialogKit` (`DialogSize::Compute`) under **Analyze > Descriptive Statistics > TURF Analysis...**.\n  - Added Output Viewer Pivot Tables (Case & Parameter Summary, Reach and Frequency per cycle/size with variable `Label` resolution), vector Reach & Frequency curves, and TSV/HTML/TXT export.\n- **Global Static i18n Linter (`xtask i18n-guard`):**\n  - Added `xtask/src/i18n_guard.rs` and integrated it into `xtask ci` to enforce zero raw UI strings or unlocalized table headers across all dialogs and views."
      },
      "id": "blk_native_paragraph_1795702921252941000",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
