    {
      "data": {
        "text": "- **TURF & Output Viewer:** Fixed `frequency_pct` (`% of Responses`) denominator to divide by total positive responses across active variables instead of valid case count, localized all TURF and Explore report table headers (`Parameter | Value`, etc.), and fixed `TurfDialog` right sidebar column width."
