      "data": {
        "text": "- **Theil–Sen Estimator (Feature 032):** Robust simple linear regression, Mann–Kendall trend test, Bootstrap, PRE/RES saving, scatter/residual plots, and `THEIL SEN` `.sps` syntax.\n- **Orthogonal / Deming Regression (Feature 033):** Closed-form Deming (`lambda = 1.0` & custom `lambda > 0`), Jackknife SE & t-CI, Bootstrap, PRE/RES saving, scatter plot with `Y=X` line, and `ORTHOGONAL REGRESSION` `.sps` syntax.\n- **Linux AppImage:** Automated `statcraft-linux-x64.AppImage` build in GitHub Releases."
