    {
      "data": {
        "text": "- **Architectural Decomposition of App Dialog Coordinator (BUG-018):**\n  - Proactively decomposed `crates/statcraft_app/src/app_dialogs.rs` to prevent exceeding the 1000-line coordinator ceiling (Rule 12.1/12.2), extracting canonical descriptive procedures into `crates/statcraft_app/src/app_dialogs_stats.rs` (284 lines).\n- **Typography Rendering in Output Viewer & Format Preview (BUG-019):**\n  - Resolved `egui` italic and bold conflict where `painter.text` suppressed italics and `RichText::strong` was overridden by custom text colors. Synthesized robust faux bold over slanted `Galley` via `LayoutJob`."
